% wave-source: pdf=ChapmanRizzoli5.pdf; page=52; trim=175bp 530bp 150bp 45bp
% Source: Wave Motions in the Ocean, printed p.147 (physical p.52).
% Orthographic vector reconstruction of the source globe sketch.
% The surrounding beta-plane ray solution is sinusoidal in the meridional
% coordinate, so the ray is generated from a sinusoidal latitude law whose
% extrema coincide exactly with the two trapping latitudes. The figure retains
% the source labels +/- theta_T; the corrected dimensional algebra uses y_T
% in the surrounding text (see ERRATA.md).
\par\smallskip
